                "text": "In the last year, nearly 40% of Americans put off medical treatment because they couldn't pay for it.\n\nWhile @HouseDemocrats are working to make health care more affordable, MAGA Republicans want to cut Social Security & Medicare benefits for thousands of Central Coast seniors.",
