                "text": "I told Ava & her Mother Vanessa that I'm committed to investing more in pediatric cancer research, lowering treatment costs, and finally achieving not just a cure for cancer, but also a health care system that puts no family in financial peril just for seeking the care they need. https://t.co/WTLXeKDchQ",
