                "text": "Over 600 people on the Central Coast rely on life-saving dialysis treatment from the @DaVita San Luis Obispo Clinic.\n\nI had the opportunity to meet some of their phenomenal medical professionals and get a glimpse into the vital work they do for our community. \ud83e\udd7c\ud83e\ude7a https://t.co/fvYNtxrwOc",
