                "text": "My heart is broken to learn of Ava Decker\u2019s passing.\n\nAva turned unbelievable adversity into advocacy, calling on me and others to fight for better childhood cancer treatment and care.\n\nI will proudly carry her memory & passion with me as I continue to work towards those goals. https://t.co/itQNmL6Fvj",
