                "text": "Today, on #WorldAIDSDay, we remember the lives lost to HIV/AIDS and reaffirm our commitment to ending this epidemic.\n\nWe must fight for equitable health care, support for those affected, and a future where everyone can access prevention and treatment. https://t.co/ds2SqhoIlP",
