                "quoted_status_profile_username": "AP",
                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m deeply disturbed by the targeted murder of MN State Rep. Melissa Hortman and her husband. My thoughts are with MN Sen. John Hoffman and his wife as they undergo medical treatment. My heart goes out to the families and loved ones of both lawmakers in the wake of this horrific attack.\n\nI condemn this brutal act of violence. Those responsible must be prosecuted to the fullest extent of the law.",
